      "body": "The Federal Bank Limited announced that at its board meeting held on April 29, 2026, the board of the bank has recommended the payment of final dividend at INR 1.20 per equity share of the face value INR 2 each (60%) for the financial year ended March 31, 2026 subject to the approval of the Shareholders at the upcoming Annual General Meeting of the Bank.",
