      "body": "Analysts have nudged their fair value estimate for Federal Bank slightly lower to about ₹294 per share from roughly ₹295, reflecting small model adjustments to the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E assumptions while keeping the core thesis intact. Analyst Commentary Street research on another regulated utility stock highlights how external analysts are thinking about valuation, execution and growth in capital intensive, rate regulated businesses.",
