      "body": "Analysts have kept their fair value estimate for Federal Bank steady at about ₹294.78, with only marginal tweaks to assumptions such as discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E, similar to how recent Street research in other sectors has adjusted price targets mainly to reflect updated peer multiples and refreshed models rather than a change in fundamental view. Analyst Commentary Recent Street research on other financial and utility names offers a useful reference point for how Federal Bank is being framed.",
